Package: cyd32
Version: 0.3.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: CYD32 contributors <777082+b-air@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: iproute2, iw, network-manager, libcap2-bin, curl, ca-certificates, python3
Recommends: usbutils, bluez, firmware-mediatek
Description: CYD32 receive-only sonar for the CardputerZero carousel
 APPLaunch application. The UI has no capabilities. A separate helper
 is installed mode 0750, owner root:cyd32, with CAP_NET_ADMIN and
 CAP_NET_RAW only. Q, or Esc on the sonar, returns to the carousel.
